evidence:cmvbtm45f0017bnuottzwhp9k:0003,video:cmvbtm45f0017bnuottzwhp9k,supadata:description,metadata,description_text,0,"一個要走，一個要留，邊個能夠堅持到最後？ 開閂開閂，你收我放，邊個受得住呢份煎熬？ 無論呢場打情罵俏持續幾耐， PAX衣櫃都保證陪到你咁耐！ IKEA多款產品10年品質保證 保證做你十指緊扣嘅強大後盾！👉🏻 https://bit.ly/31ky284 【春日好禮】 由2021年3月25日至4月11日， yuu會員凡購物滿$500，送你$30現金獎賞；滿$1,000，送你$100 現金獎賞。數量有限，送完即止。 ​ 👉🏻 https://bit.ly/3rmQmIt #床頭鬧交衣櫃和 #愛之深開閂之切 #來讓IKEA跟你走 #PAX衣櫃耐磨防潮堅固耐用 #KOMPLEMENT抽屜通過2萬次開關測試 #耐得住的好品質 When one wants it all and the other wants to let it go...how can you decide?​ No matter how long you play this game of back and forth, the PAX wardrobe will always be there for you with our IKEA 10-year guarantee. IKEA many products with 10-year guarantee! 👉🏻 https://bit.ly/2PrUPw4 【IKEA Spring Reward】 From 25th March - 11th April 2021, yuu member will get $30 Cash Reward upon purchase of $500; $100 Cash Reward upon purchase of $1,000. While stock lasts. 👉🏻 https://bit.ly/3lSXdrV","""一個要走，一個要留，邊個能夠堅持到最後？ 開閂開閂，你收我放，邊個受得住呢份煎熬？ 無論呢場打情罵俏持續幾耐， PAX衣櫃都保證陪到你咁耐！ IKEA多款產品10年品質保證 保證做你十指緊扣嘅強大後盾！👉🏻 https://bit.ly/31ky284 【春日好禮】 由2021年3月25日至4月11日， yuu會員凡購物滿$500，送你$30現金獎賞；滿$1,000，送你$100 現金獎賞。數量有限，送完即止。 ​ 👉🏻 https://bit.ly/3rmQmIt #床頭鬧交衣櫃和 #愛之深開閂之切 #來讓IKEA跟你走 #PAX衣櫃耐磨防潮堅固耐用 #KOMPLEMENT抽屜通過2萬次開關測試 #耐得住的好品質 When one wants it all and the other wants to let it go...how can you decide?​ No matter how long you play this game of back and forth, the PAX wardrobe will always be there for you with our IKEA 10-year guarantee. IKEA many products with 10-year guarantee! 👉🏻 https://bit.ly/2PrUPw4 【IKEA Spring Reward】 From 25th March - 11th April 2021, yuu member will get $30 Cash Reward upon purchase of $500; $100 Cash Reward upon purchase of $1,000. While stock lasts. 👉🏻 https://bit.ly/3lSXdrV""",supadata,supadata_metadata,0.85,0.84,2026-10-17T03:12:11.309Z,canonicalAnalysis.evidence.raw.metadata[2].value,source_raw,
