evidence:cmvbtlkpb0012bnuob0wm8e7h:0003,video:cmvbtlkpb0012bnuob0wm8e7h,supadata:description,metadata,description_text,0,"一個要走，一個要留，邊個能夠堅持到最後？ 開閂開閂，你收我放，邊個受得住呢份煎熬？ 無論呢場打情罵俏持續幾耐， PAX衣櫃都保證陪到你咁耐！ IKEA多款產品10年品質保證 保證做你十指緊扣嘅強大後盾！👉🏻 https://bit.ly/31ky284​ #床頭鬧交衣櫃和​ #愛之深開閂之切​ #來讓IKEA跟你走​ #PAX衣櫃耐磨防潮堅固耐用​ #KOMPLEMENT抽屜通過2萬次開關測試​ #耐得住的好品質​ When one wants it all and the other wants to let it go...how can you decide?​ No matter how long you play this game of back and forth, the PAX wardrobe will always be there for you with our IKEA 10-year guarantee. IKEA many products with 10-year guarantee! 👉🏻 https://bit.ly/2PrUPw4​","""一個要走，一個要留，邊個能夠堅持到最後？ 開閂開閂，你收我放，邊個受得住呢份煎熬？ 無論呢場打情罵俏持續幾耐， PAX衣櫃都保證陪到你咁耐！ IKEA多款產品10年品質保證 保證做你十指緊扣嘅強大後盾！👉🏻 https://bit.ly/31ky284​ #床頭鬧交衣櫃和​ #愛之深開閂之切​ #來讓IKEA跟你走​ #PAX衣櫃耐磨防潮堅固耐用​ #KOMPLEMENT抽屜通過2萬次開關測試​ #耐得住的好品質​ When one wants it all and the other wants to let it go...how can you decide?​ No matter how long you play this game of back and forth, the PAX wardrobe will always be there for you with our IKEA 10-year guarantee. IKEA many products with 10-year guarantee! 👉🏻 https://bit.ly/2PrUPw4​""",supadata,supadata_metadata,0.85,0.84,2026-10-17T03:11:46.104Z,canonicalAnalysis.evidence.raw.metadata[2].value,source_raw,
