evidence:cmvbticur000ibnuo3g8w7j5m:0003,video:cmvbticur000ibnuo3g8w7j5m,supadata:description,metadata,description_text,0,"「早抖喇BB～」「BB早抖～」 瞓著前仲係枕邊人，點諗到瞓覺之後變咗做邊緣人？ 無論你點對我，我都會落力搵你好，因為想你瞓得好。 一齊瞓覺好：https://www.ikea.com.hk/zh/online-shopping/complete-sleep #睡好覺做好夢 ""Goodnight babe~"" ""Night night~"" Still your dearest while awake, but not so much once you snooze? No matter my place, I'll always give my best to you, for you to have a good night’s sleep. Sleep well tonight, together: https://www.ikea.com.hk/en/online-shopping/complete-sleep #WakeUpItsTimeToSleep","""「早抖喇BB～」「BB早抖～」 瞓著前仲係枕邊人，點諗到瞓覺之後變咗做邊緣人？ 無論你點對我，我都會落力搵你好，因為想你瞓得好。 一齊瞓覺好：https://www.ikea.com.hk/zh/online-shopping/complete-sleep #睡好覺做好夢 \""Goodnight babe~\"" \""Night night~\"" Still your dearest while awake, but not so much once you snooze? No matter my place, I'll always give my best to you, for you to have a good night’s sleep. Sleep well tonight, together: https://www.ikea.com.hk/en/online-shopping/complete-sleep #WakeUpItsTimeToSleep""",supadata,supadata_metadata,0.85,0.84,2026-10-17T03:09:15.967Z,canonicalAnalysis.evidence.raw.metadata[2].value,source_raw,
