evidence:cmvbthj43000dbnuo1zjduj9k:0003,video:cmvbthj43000dbnuo1zjduj9k,supadata:description,metadata,description_text,0,"忍住，忍住…喺伴侶面前，要忍住… 好多嘢都可以忍，但有啲嘢真係冇得等！ 好彩有IKEA為情侶打造完美睡房，晚晚咁好瞓，就算核爆都可以床好打交床尾和啦！ 忍唔住要買：https://www.ikea.com.hk/zh/online-shopping/complete-sleep #睡好覺做好夢 Hold it in, hold it in... In front of your love, you have to hold it in... There are many things you can endure, but some things just can't wait! With the perfect couple bedroom by IKEA, good sleep is guaranteed each night - even if you let out an explosion, you can always make up in bed! Can't hold any longer but buy: https://www.ikea.com.hk/en/online-shopping/complete-sleep #WakeUpItsTimeToSleep","""忍住，忍住…喺伴侶面前，要忍住… 好多嘢都可以忍，但有啲嘢真係冇得等！ 好彩有IKEA為情侶打造完美睡房，晚晚咁好瞓，就算核爆都可以床好打交床尾和啦！ 忍唔住要買：https://www.ikea.com.hk/zh/online-shopping/complete-sleep #睡好覺做好夢 Hold it in, hold it in... In front of your love, you have to hold it in... There are many things you can endure, but some things just can't wait! With the perfect couple bedroom by IKEA, good sleep is guaranteed each night - even if you let out an explosion, you can always make up in bed! Can't hold any longer but buy: https://www.ikea.com.hk/en/online-shopping/complete-sleep #WakeUpItsTimeToSleep""",supadata,supadata_metadata,0.85,0.84,2026-10-17T03:08:37.467Z,canonicalAnalysis.evidence.raw.metadata[2].value,source_raw,
