evidence:cmvbtndsl001kbnuopa1cj9rj:0003,video:cmvbtndsl001kbnuopa1cj9rj,supadata:description,metadata,description_text,0,媽咪有大事宣布......💬為一家人帶嚟意想不到嘅全新改變～ 你呢？你鍾意嘅生活又係點嘅？打造居家新方案，活出你喜歡的新生活！ 即刻睇 2021全新產品目錄: https://bit.ly/3kdAy8C #活出你喜歡的新生活 #為愛留好空間 #今天開始我要做隻貓 #鯊鯊生活 #熊熊生活🐻 #豬豬生活🐷 Mum is announcing something big that’s going to bring a surprising new change to the family! Do you have an ideal lifestyle? Decorate your home now to fit your new way of living. Check out our 2021 new catalogue now: https://bit.ly/31pGYZw #LiveTheLifeYouLove #AHappySpaceForTheOnesYouLove #FromNowOnIWantToLiveLikeACat #SharkLife #BearLife🐻 #PiggieLife🐷 -------------------------------------------------------- 更多生活靈感 IKEA 網站 https://bit.ly/2C3AFCs IKEA Hong Kong Facebook http://bit.ly/2OGKYMQ More Inspiration: IKEA site https://bit.ly/2C3AFCs IKEA Hong Kong Facebook http://bit.ly/2OGKYMQ,"""媽咪有大事宣布......💬為一家人帶嚟意想不到嘅全新改變～ 你呢？你鍾意嘅生活又係點嘅？打造居家新方案，活出你喜歡的新生活！ 即刻睇 2021全新產品目錄: https://bit.ly/3kdAy8C #活出你喜歡的新生活 #為愛留好空間 #今天開始我要做隻貓 #鯊鯊生活 #熊熊生活🐻 #豬豬生活🐷 Mum is announcing something big that’s going to bring a surprising new change to the family! Do you have an ideal lifestyle? Decorate your home now to fit your new way of living. Check out our 2021 new catalogue now: https://bit.ly/31pGYZw #LiveTheLifeYouLove #AHappySpaceForTheOnesYouLove #FromNowOnIWantToLiveLikeACat #SharkLife #BearLife🐻 #PiggieLife🐷 -------------------------------------------------------- 更多生活靈感 IKEA 網站 https://bit.ly/2C3AFCs IKEA Hong Kong Facebook http://bit.ly/2OGKYMQ More Inspiration: IKEA site https://bit.ly/2C3AFCs IKEA Hong Kong Facebook http://bit.ly/2OGKYMQ""",supadata,supadata_metadata,0.85,0.84,2026-10-17T03:13:25.167Z,canonicalAnalysis.evidence.raw.metadata[2].value,source_raw,
