evidence:cmvbtl040000xbnuo3hv72oqd:0003,video:cmvbtl040000xbnuo3hv72oqd,supadata:description,metadata,description_text,0,"此影片內的價格有效期至2021年12月30日。 The product prices in this video are valid till 30 December 2021. ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓ 二人世界嘅唔完美，並唔係屋企太細 而係父母難得嚟到，但只可以罰企門口咁傾偈 ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛ 唔使搞大工程，就可以招呼人客又不失禮貌～ 即刻睇下IKEA點樣再創低價，開展親家新關係！ 買到就係賺到嘅IKEA超抵產品：https://bit.ly/3oX95LJ #突然殺上嚟都冇有怕 #不尷尬又不失禮貌 #想聚埋就聚埋就靠IKEA #想買就買都要靠IKEA #餐檯書檯雙用途摺板檯只係1690 #低價創造無價 ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓ How do you know your home is too small? It’s not by the size but by fact that when your parents visit, there’s only enough space to chat by the door. ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛ You don’t need to complete a major renovation the next time you invite someone over. Just visit IKEA and check out the affordable products that’ll make you the in-laws’ favourite! With such good deals at IKEA, it’s like you’re earning more when you shop: https://bit.ly/3oED8HH #SuddenVisitNoProblem #DontBeEmbarrassedStayPolite #GatherAnytimeYouWantWithIKEA #BuyWheneverYouWantWithIKEAToo #MultiusageTableOnly1690 #AffordableMakesWonderful","""此影片內的價格有效期至2021年12月30日。 The product prices in this video are valid till 30 December 2021. ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓ 二人世界嘅唔完美，並唔係屋企太細 而係父母難得嚟到，但只可以罰企門口咁傾偈 ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛ 唔使搞大工程，就可以招呼人客又不失禮貌～ 即刻睇下IKEA點樣再創低價，開展親家新關係！ 買到就係賺到嘅IKEA超抵產品：https://bit.ly/3oX95LJ #突然殺上嚟都冇有怕 #不尷尬又不失禮貌 #想聚埋就聚埋就靠IKEA #想買就買都要靠IKEA #餐檯書檯雙用途摺板檯只係1690 #低價創造無價 ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓ How do you know your home is too small? It’s not by the size but by fact that when your parents visit, there’s only enough space to chat by the door. ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛ You don’t need to complete a major renovation the next time you invite someone over. Just visit IKEA and check out the affordable products that’ll make you the in-laws’ favourite! With such good deals at IKEA, it’s like you’re earning more when you shop: https://bit.ly/3oED8HH #SuddenVisitNoProblem #DontBeEmbarrassedStayPolite #GatherAnytimeYouWantWithIKEA #BuyWheneverYouWantWithIKEAToo #MultiusageTableOnly1690 #AffordableMakesWonderful""",supadata,supadata_metadata,0.85,0.84,2026-10-17T03:11:19.399Z,canonicalAnalysis.evidence.raw.metadata[2].value,source_raw,
