evidence:cmvbtes5p0005bnuotzavlabc:0003,video:cmvbtes5p0005bnuotzavlabc,supadata:description,metadata,description_text,0,"由平時收收埋埋嘅「小聰明」、 屋企小霸王畫足成日嘅「細界級傑作」、 未出發先興奮嘅「Annual Leave」、 不為人知嘅「反差萌」... 每一件物件，都代表生活中最真實嘅一面； 每一個 IKEA 收納產品，都裝載住你獨一無二嘅故事。 屋企嘅滿足，從來唔係來自呎數。 空間有限，IKEA 總有專屬貯物組合，裝得落你嘅無限所愛。 為最愛留低最好嘅空間：https://bit.ly/4ycrR3t #IKEAHK #為愛留好空間 #越係愛就越要有心裝載 #IKEA通通裝得落 From your proudest little achievement, to your kid’s “world-class” masterpieces, the travel essentials for your next annual leave, your soft side no one knew about… Every item says something about who we are. And every IKEA storage product holds a story that’s uniquely yours. A happy home is never about how much space you have. Space may be limited, but IKEA always has a storage solution for all the things you care about. Let’s make room for what you love: https://bit.ly/4xwrf8P","""由平時收收埋埋嘅「小聰明」、 屋企小霸王畫足成日嘅「細界級傑作」、 未出發先興奮嘅「Annual Leave」、 不為人知嘅「反差萌」... 每一件物件，都代表生活中最真實嘅一面； 每一個 IKEA 收納產品，都裝載住你獨一無二嘅故事。 屋企嘅滿足，從來唔係來自呎數。 空間有限，IKEA 總有專屬貯物組合，裝得落你嘅無限所愛。 為最愛留低最好嘅空間：https://bit.ly/4ycrR3t #IKEAHK #為愛留好空間 #越係愛就越要有心裝載 #IKEA通通裝得落 From your proudest little achievement, to your kid’s “world-class” masterpieces, the travel essentials for your next annual leave, your soft side no one knew about… Every item says something about who we are. And every IKEA storage product holds a story that’s uniquely yours. A happy home is never about how much space you have. Space may be limited, but IKEA always has a storage solution for all the things you care about. Let’s make room for what you love: https://bit.ly/4xwrf8P""",supadata,supadata_metadata,0.85,0.84,2026-10-17T03:06:29.176Z,canonicalAnalysis.evidence.raw.metadata[2].value,source_raw,
