evidence:cmvbtdsug0000bnuovtsoez1h:0003,video:cmvbtdsug0000bnuovtsoez1h,supadata:description,metadata,description_text,0,"由平時收收埋埋嘅「小聰明」、 屋企小霸王畫足成日嘅「細界級傑作」、 未出發先興奮嘅「Annual Leave」、 不為人知嘅「反差萌」、 充滿回憶嘅「紀念冊」... 每一件物件，都代表生活中最真實嘅一面； 每一個 IKEA 收納產品，都裝載住你獨一無二嘅故事。 屋企嘅滿足，從來唔係來自呎數。 空間有限，IKEA 總有專屬貯物組合，裝得落你嘅無限所愛。 為最愛留低最好嘅空間：bit.ly/有心裝載 #IKEAHK #為愛留好空間 #越係愛就越要有心裝載 #IKEA通通裝得落 From your proudest little achievement, to your kid’s “world-class” masterpieces, the travel essentials for your next annual leave, your soft side no one knew about, the good old days with full of memories... Every item says something about who we are. And every IKEA storage product holds a story that’s uniquely yours. A happy home is never about how much space you have. Space may be limited, but IKEA always has a storage solution for all the things you care about. Let’s make room for what you love: bit.ly/unlimited_love","""由平時收收埋埋嘅「小聰明」、 屋企小霸王畫足成日嘅「細界級傑作」、 未出發先興奮嘅「Annual Leave」、 不為人知嘅「反差萌」、 充滿回憶嘅「紀念冊」... 每一件物件，都代表生活中最真實嘅一面； 每一個 IKEA 收納產品，都裝載住你獨一無二嘅故事。 屋企嘅滿足，從來唔係來自呎數。 空間有限，IKEA 總有專屬貯物組合，裝得落你嘅無限所愛。 為最愛留低最好嘅空間：bit.ly/有心裝載 #IKEAHK #為愛留好空間 #越係愛就越要有心裝載 #IKEA通通裝得落 From your proudest little achievement, to your kid’s “world-class” masterpieces, the travel essentials for your next annual leave, your soft side no one knew about, the good old days with full of memories... Every item says something about who we are. And every IKEA storage product holds a story that’s uniquely yours. A happy home is never about how much space you have. Space may be limited, but IKEA always has a storage solution for all the things you care about. Let’s make room for what you love: bit.ly/unlimited_love""",supadata,supadata_metadata,0.85,0.84,2026-10-17T03:05:44.071Z,canonicalAnalysis.evidence.raw.metadata[2].value,source_raw,
